d  unique yes it's magnetic as you can see  the camera magnetically attaches with an  incredibly powerful magnet and it's  awesome because there's a very wide  angle of adjustment that you can do and  the magnet still holds on so well making  it very easy to make micro adjustments  now this Mount can also be fastened to a  surface using the traditional method  with some screws and it locks into place  the same way however there's the  extremely unique zero tool method of  installation if you have a magnetic  surface that works for you simply just  plop it on and then put the camera right  on the mounts bam you are done but they  also include a 3M sticker that holds on  very well you simply stick it on the  back of the magnetic Mount then stick  that onto any flat surface apply some  pressure and there you go it also holds  on extremely well then simply place the  camera onto the mount and voila zero  tool installation complete in literally  just seconds I've never seen a more  convenient installation before and that  is actually the method that I went with  and it's still holding on just fine even  in the freezing winter cold it was  literally 15 degrees last night now the  awesome thing about the magnetic Mount  is that you could easily take it off to  charge it and you can actually use both  the traditional and magnetic Mount and  switch between different locations if  you want to and it actually allowed me  to do the installation before I actually  set up the camera with the app so let's  get into how easy that was to set it up  I just downloaded the norio app made a  free account and then added the camera  by simply scanning the QR code on the  back and then connecting it to my Wi-Fi  and Bam that was basically it super easy  to set up so with that said let me  actually go into the app itself and show  you how it works check this out this is  the main page we have the camera which  is set up as my front door you just tap  on it there you go it's loading up and  as you can see it's November and we have  snow everywhere you can simply just zoom  in move it around look at that this is a  live preview you can see the time stamps  right there it works very very well you  could even jump into this widescreen  view there you go look at that wide  screen and man the picture quality is  very sharp this is actually 2K quality  you can zoom in and clearly see people's  faces if you need to that right there is  awesome now what's really cool is that  you could actually hit this call button  right here and you could actually talk  to people outside let me try to turn on  the volume yep I can hear background  noise out there if there was somebody  out there  I'd be able to hear them so you can see  I can literally talk to people if they  come up warn them tell them to leave  there's a mute button right here so you  can turn on the speaker and hear what's  going on here's an alarm check this out  [Music]  yep the alarm is going off I should  probably turn it off before it gets too  annoying  okay there you go I turned it off so it  works quite well and there's also This  little light button because it comes  with a built-in light LED light that  works actually very well and at night  you can turn this on and switch from the  night vision mode which works very well  into the full color mode the really cool  thing is you can go back into time and  you can see this is when we were leaving  in our car that's my wife putting our  kids into the car and you can just keep  going I mean this is a really really  cool app oh that's when I was setting it  up  that's awesome and then just click that  button to go back to live there you go  very Snappy and responsive as you can  see we have the settings button right  there go in we have the motion detection  you can change the sensitivity you can  change and add activity zones which is  really cool if you want to avoid the  street if you have some false triggers  but surprisingly the notifications have  been spot on and only triggering when  there is somebody there so I'm really  impressed by the default settings we  have the video settings you can change  the video mode for night vision  Watermark you can rotate it if you have  it flipped here you can change your  notifications which you can add a rich  notification with a snapshot thumbnail I  definitely want to have that on change  your power management so it uses less  battery you can see we're at 77 percent  still so much more to go you have your  privacy security recording the audio  privacy zones if you want to block  something off and of course you have the  storage which is going to slowly fill up  up it has actually 16 gigs which it's  barely used any but you can easily and  quickly clear it to reset it if nothing  happened and then back to the home page  you actually have these different modes  you can switch to and you could actually  have it be location based so when you  come home it'll switch to the home mode  and then when you leave it'll be turn to  away so that way if somebody comes it  can trigger the alarm and scare somebody  off but when you're home you can choose  to make it not do that or maybe at night  you can have it go off and there's also  this security tab to adjust and  customize all of those modes including  the Geo fencing for location tracking  and you can even turn on automation if  you have multiple cameras set up so  overall I'm very surprised by the  reliability of this app so with all that  said if you combine the zero tool  installation with the really unique  magnetic Mount as well as the very easy  app setup and the reliability the whole  package together I really recommend this  camera it works so well very easy  installation the notifications work spot  on every time no issues at all I'm very  impressed with the norio wireless  security camera so that's my take  hopefully you enjoyed this video and  don't forget that they're doing a  giveaway campaign so use the link below  and they have direct purchase links to  Amazon Down Below in the description and  pinned comment as well so hopefully you  enjoy this video and if you did click  the circle above to subscribe check out  one of those two videos right there  thanks for watching and we'll see you in  the next one  foreign  [Music]

